# WorkFlowHub solution placeholder

The production-style solution structure will be added incrementally:

- `src/WorkFlowHub.Api` — ASP.NET Core Web API
- `src/WorkFlowHub.Application` — use cases and business orchestration
- `src/WorkFlowHub.Domain` — entities and domain rules
- `src/WorkFlowHub.Infrastructure` — EF Core, SQL Server, persistence and external integrations
- `tests/` — unit and integration tests
- `frontend/` — Angular application
